  "method": "Three fresh processes, rotated order, warm OS caches and prepared kit cache. First call then 1000 warmup calls, seven batches of 10000 calls. Additional 50000 individually timed calls per process; pooled p95 from 150000. Timer control measured separately and not subtracted. Retained callable/arrays. Common O3 Eigen object in pybind11/nanobind; Rust LLT versus Eigen LDLT. Launch-to-warm includes interpreter, imports, input setup, preparation, first call, 1000 calls and pipe notification. Shared workstation, no CPU pinning.",
